(:id "dart/W16" :state :unknown :note "the clause \"nested union answers outer tag\" is unproved: the generated Dart plan carries nine lanes (TableFixedLane.lanes = 9, internal/codegen/darttable/fixedruntime.go) with one guard/arg/argw triple and no second guard lane; ir/fixedform.go:903 carries Guard2/Arg2/ArgW2 but the Dart identity plan (internal/codegen/darttable/fixedplan.go) stamps only the innermost union's tag, so an arm inside an arm does not answer to the outer tag. Adding the second lane is a generated-plan-format change not made here.")
(:id "dart/R28" :state :unknown :note "the clause \"the guard chain: the plan entry carries offset+count into a pool of (guard, arg, argw) links, outermost first, the only bound the layout's 64\" is unproved: no guard pool or per-entry guard link count exists in the Dart runtime (the plan is a flat nine-lane Int32List read at internal/codegen/darttable/fixedruntime.go), so the chain and its 64 bound are unimplemented on this leg; the owed implementation is a plan-format change not made here.")
